 or döner kebab is a Turkish dish made of meat cooked on a vertical rotisserie. Seasoned meat stacked in the shape of an inverted cone is turned slowly on the rotisserie, next to a vertical cooking element. The operator uses a knife to slice thin shavings from the outer layer of the meat as it cooks. The vertical rotisserie was invented in the 19th-century Ottoman Empire, and dishes such as the Arab shawarma, Greek gyros, Greek-Canadian donair, and Mexican al pastor are derived from the rotisserie technique of this dish."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-doner-kebab"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doner_kebab"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Turkish cuisine","cuisine/turkish-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":5,"links":[["Beef","ingredient/beef"],["Chicken","ingredient/chicken"],["Flatbread","ingredient/flatbread"],["Lamb","ingredient/lamb"],["Pork","ingredient/pork"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Ozlem's Turkish Table","ref":"site/ozlemsturkishtable-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"ozlemsturkishtable.com","note":"Turkish-born cook and teacher Ozlem Warren's blog of home-style Turkish recipes.","url":"https://ozlemsturkishtable.com/tag/turkish-recipes/page/9","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Turkish cuisine","links":[["Adana kebabı","dish/adana-kebab"],["Baba ghanoush","dish/baba-ghanoush"],["Bici bici","dish/bici-bici"],["Boortsog","dish/boortsog"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Çiğ köfte","dish/cig-kofte"],["Çökertme kebabı","dish/cokertme-kebab"],["Dede (restaurant)","dish/dede-restaurant"],["Düğün çorbası","dish/dugun-corbas"],["Eggplant jam","dish/eggplant-jam"],["İmam bayıldı","dish/imam-bay-ld"],["İskender kebap","dish/iskender-kebap"],["Kavurma","dish/kavurma"],["Keşkek","dish/keskek"],["Kuru fasulye","dish/kuru-fasulye"],["Kyopolou","dish/kyopolou"],["Mesir macunu","dish/mesir-macunu"],["Nevzine tatlısı","dish/nevzine-tatl-s"],["Ntolmás","dish/ntolmas"],["Pilaf",